;; Luigi's Mirror Race (the mini game that frees him): The Lost Levels' 1-1 for a race, from our
;; own converted ll-1-1.map. Its first three and a half screens (the Paratroopa, the red Koopa's
;; brick box, the poison mushroom's ? row, the three piranha pipes) run straight into its last
;; four and a half (the plant pipes, the hidden-block pipe, the end staircase and the flagpole);
;; the tiles are the level's own. The middle, two brick bridges over wide pits, wants pixel-exact
;; jumps that a one-life race can't ask of a careful player (race.test.ts's human sim).
;; race.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not in the level library, the dev level select or the
;; campaign.
id: luigi-race
name: MIRROR RACE
world: 1
stage: 1
theme: overworld
music: overworld
time: 400
start: 2,12
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

